  "describe": "Two 3D charts. Top: rainfall bars, six months across (Jan to Jun) by three cities into the screen (London blue, Seattle orange, Mumbai green), floor and two back walls with gridlines, 'Rain (mm)' 0 to 600 up the left; Mumbai's June bar towers at about 485. Legend London, Seattle, Mumbai. Bottom: the saddle z = x² − y² over −2..2, banded light to dark blue by height (−4 to 4), a grey skirt down its sides. Mono: bars as boxes with drawn edges, the saddle as a hidden-line wireframe.",
